    "# 🏦 GigScore — Agent 1: Multi-Modal Data Ingestion & Feature Engineering\n## Behavioral Credit Intelligence for India's Informal Economy\n### Barclays Hack-O-Hire 2026 · PS4: AI-Powered Alternate Credit Scoring\n**Team GigScore · Plaksha University · March 28–29, 2026**\n\n---\n\n> *\"CIBIL is a calculator. GigScore is a team of AI analysts.\"*\n\nThis notebook is **Agent 1** of the 7-agent GigScore pipeline. Its sole job:\ningest four raw datasets, identify India's gig worker cohort, engineer\n**behavioural velocity features** that no CIBIL-style model captures, merge\neverything into a single clean feature matrix, and hand it to Agent 2 (XGBoost).\n\n### What Agent 1 Produces\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `GigScore_Master_Dataset.csv` | 22 000+ gig worker records, 50+ features, zero nulls |\n| 8 Behavioural Velocity Features | Custom signals for irregular-income workers |\n| UPI Transaction Profile | Per-state digital behaviour features |\n| PLFS Income Validation | Government-survey-backed income inflation flags |\n| Train / Test Split | Stratified 80/20 split for AUC evaluation |\n| Visualisations | 10 publication-quality charts |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 0 — Imports & Configuration"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
