    "---\n## Step 7 — Join UPI Features via Region Rating\n\nWe map UPI state-level features to gig workers using `REGION_RATING_CLIENT`\nas a bridge. This is the correct proxy join for hackathon data — in production\nMode 3 (Account Aggregator), this becomes a direct per-applicant join on\nconsented transaction data.\n"
